    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Maths feels like a bridge between abstract ideas and real-world logic—something I can’t ignore but also find fascinating when broken down into patterns. My parents’ education levels made me curious about how systems work, so equations became my playground. Though challenging at times, it’s rewarding to see connections unfold.",
